; S36: the AustralVM unified application/VM.
;
; `config.ml` + `unikernel.ml` are the Mirage manifest/job (packaging the
; compiler-as-plugin application as a unikernel). The Mirage toolchain is an
; optional dev dependency (opam install mirage) and is NOT required for the
; workspace build — this directory only builds `compiler_vm_test`, a plain
; executable that exercises the same boot + registry routing without Mirage
; (it is the unikernel's `boot_and_compile` under the unix backend).
;
; The `config.ml`/`unikernel.ml` files themselves are not compiled by dune
; unless the user runs `mirage configure` (which generates its own dune
; files). Keeping them unbuilt here avoids a hard Mirage dependency.
(executable
 (name compiler_vm_test)
 (modules compiler_vm_test)
 (libraries austral_lib))

; Run as part of `dune runtest` (LD_LIBRARY_PATH must include the cranelift
; bridge dir, as with the other test executables).
(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps compiler_vm_test.exe)
 (action (run %{exe:compiler_vm_test.exe})))
